# The two LFOs. LFO 1: rate 0x18, AM depth 0x19 (bit 7 clear), PM depth 0x19
# (bit 7 set), waveform 0x1B bits 0-1, sensitivities 0x38 (bit 7 clear). LFO 2:
# rate 0x16, AM depth 0x17, PM depth 0x17 with bit 7, waveform 0x1B bits 2-3,
# sensitivities 0x38 with bit 7. Each waveform of each LFO alone at full
# depths with PMS 7 and AMS 3, PMS and AMS swept on each, both together
# (added), rates slow to fast, and the sync bits (0x1B bits 4 and 5), which
# reset an LFO's counter at each key-on.
